OL,3,GNEWSAMan cleared of city rooftop garden
OL,4,Amurder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 50-year-old man has been found not
OL,7,Fguilty of murdering another man, whose
OL,8,Fbody was discovered in a garden on top
OL,9,Fof a block of flats.
OL,11,FAnthony Clemmings, 54, who was known as
OL,12,FTony, was found dead in the rooftop
OL,13,Fgarden on Redcliff Street in Bristol,
OL,14,Fat about 08:20 GMT on 5 May.
OL,16,FNigel Lubban, of no fixed abode,
OL,17,Fappeared at Bristol Crown Court on
OL,18,FWednesday to hear the jury clear him of
OL,19,Fmurder.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
